WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.719 --> 00:00:08.312
Hi!

00:00:08.336 --> 00:00:09.195
 I'm Ana.

00:00:09.281 --> 00:00:10.921
Welcome to 'What to Say!'

00:00:31.748 --> 00:00:34.716
Do you know what to say when you want to apologise?

00:00:34.771 --> 00:00:38.528
Listen out for useful language for apologising.

00:00:38.943 --> 00:00:41.943
Then, we'll practise saying the new phrases –

00:00:42.021 --> 00:00:43.407
 after this.

00:00:48.884 --> 00:00:49.673
Noelia!

00:00:50.549 --> 00:00:53.071
I am so sorry! Are you OK?

00:00:53.283 --> 00:00:55.178
I think so.

00:00:55.709 --> 00:00:57.787
That was lucky.

00:00:58.295 --> 00:01:00.629
I'm really sorry! I didn't see you!

00:01:00.952 --> 00:01:02.381
That's all right.

00:01:02.604 --> 00:01:04.225
I shouldn't have been running.

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:07.213
No, no, I should have been paying attention.

00:01:07.242 --> 00:01:10.742
And they teach you not to run inside at school!

00:01:10.781 --> 00:01:13.664
Still, it was my fault and I'm sorry.

00:01:13.797 --> 00:01:15.289
I'm sorry too.

00:01:15.485 --> 00:01:16.742
It was both of us.

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:20.434
Honestly, it's fine.

00:01:21.052 --> 00:01:22.052
I'm fine.

00:01:22.591 --> 00:01:24.058
Don't worry about it.

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.434
Hey, I saved the laptop though!

00:01:27.697 --> 00:01:29.297
Yeah, I'll be there in …

00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:30.517
Oh no!

00:01:33.845 --> 00:01:34.845
Uh oh!

00:01:35.687 --> 00:01:36.687
Ahhhh …

00:01:41.015 --> 00:01:42.015
Hello again!

00:01:42.351 --> 00:01:44.538
Ooh, I hope Noelia's OK.

00:01:44.695 --> 00:01:49.562
So, did you notice the useful phrases used for apologising?

00:01:49.851 --> 00:01:51.851
Listen to me and then repeat.

00:01:52.383 --> 00:01:53.820
I'm so sorry!

00:01:56.547 --> 00:01:57.991
I'm so sorry!

